# Game dist rebuild

After changing a game (or wordle-core used by PolyHydra/PolyWordlot), always run the matching dist build before considering the task done:
- PolyHydra: `npm run build:polyhydra`
- PolyWordlot: `npm run build:polywordlot`
- TransWord: `npm run build:transword`
- Letterix: `npm run build:letterix`
Each writes `dist/games/...` and stamps `dist/sw.js` so `scripts/serve.js` on port 4173 serves the new files. Do not leave the user on a stale dist or only on a Vite dev port. Game help lives in `games/<id>/help/` and is copied into `dist/games/<id>/help` by the Vite help plugin (and by `copyGameRegistrations`). Site help is `app/help/site/topic.js`.
